#: ../../zh/triton_api/Scan_Sort_Ops/cumsum.md:21
msgid ""
"`cumsum` 函数计算沿指定轴的累积和（前缀和）。例如，对于输入 `[a, b, c, d]`，累积和结果为 `[a, a+b, a+b+c, "
"a+b+c+d]`。"
msgstr ""
"The `cumsum` function computes the cumulative sum (prefix sum) along the "
"specified axis. For example, for input `[a, b, c, d]`, the cumulative sum "
"result is `[a, a+b, a+b+c, a+b+c+d]`."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Scan_Sort_Ops/cumsum.md:23
msgid "当 `reverse=True` 时，计算反向累积和：`[a+b+c+d, b+c+d, c+d, d]`。"
msgstr ""
"When `reverse=True`, computes the reverse cumulative sum: `[a+b+c+d, b+c+d, "
"c+d, d]`."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Scan_Sort_Ops/cumsum.md:25
msgid "返回值： `tensor`：计算输入tensor沿指定轴的累积和，返回累积求和结果。"
msgstr ""
"Return value: `tensor`: computes the cumulative sum of the input tensor "
"along the specified axis, returning the cumulative sum result."

